data: {"type":"response.output_item.done","item":{"id":"ig_033892b3f3b8f21f016a106512593081998887cb5c4447d5d5","type":"image_generation_call","status":"generating","action":"generate","background":"opaque","output_format":"png","quality":"medium","result":"","revised_prompt":"Generate a single 1024x1024 PNG concept image, square format, for a cohesive six-image style set. Subject: damaged reactor ring map for a top-down 2D survivor game. True overhead top-down view, orthographic plan view, not isometric. Composition: a central large circular open enclosed area like a broken reactor ring, with an empty circular interior and thick damaged perimeter; three branching road lines radiating outward from the ring at uneven angles. Environment details: cracked metal floor plates, torn seams, bolts, broken panels, scorched edges, rubble-like abstract debris, readable tactical map shapes. Route design: dark pale-cyan route lines running along the roads and around parts of the ring, cyan suggests player paths; electric magenta thin danger traces near broken edges and intersections. Unified visual style: hand-painted graffiti feeling, loose concept-art candidate, rough heavy black linework, marker-pen strokes, dark cyberpunk wasteland, restrained dirty low-pollution background, muted grays, charcoal, dirty teal, rust, very subtle grimy texture. Rainbow color only as very thin edge accents, minimal and restrained. Must be readable as a top-down 2D game map tile/concept. No UI, no text, no letters, no numbers, no watermark, no logo, no characters, no sprites, no 3D, no photorealism, no pixel art. Loose style exploration, not a polished final asset.","size":"1024x1024"},"output_index":0,"sequence_number":7}

